1
00:00:14,347 --> 00:00:18,727
Wow, so this is auto-pilot mode.
I'm getting the hang of it.

2
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:23,732
Don't get carried away.
Didn't you read that helicopters crash?

3
00:00:23,815 --> 00:00:27,193
Emporio, head west. We need to go west.

4
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:31,740
Why? At this rate, we'll be
in Cape Canaveral in 30 minutes.

5
00:00:32,407 --> 00:00:33,992
It's the priest's presence.

6
00:00:34,576 --> 00:00:38,830
For some reason,
it's now in three to four locations.

7
00:00:39,706 --> 00:00:41,166
It's just west.

8
00:00:41,249 --> 00:00:45,170
I have no doubt that
he is close to Orlando.

9
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:54,429
- I feel strange.
- What?

10
00:00:55,388 --> 00:00:58,641
Ermes, my eye feels weird.

11
00:01:01,978 --> 00:01:05,857
My eyelids! They're closing!

12
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:08,568
Jolyne, something is off!

13
00:01:10,153 --> 00:01:12,322
What?

14
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:15,366
My eyelids!

15
00:01:17,702 --> 00:01:19,662
My eyes won't open!

16
00:01:19,746 --> 00:01:22,165
What's going on, Ermes?

17
00:01:22,248 --> 00:01:23,249
What is happening?

18
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:24,292
I don't know!

19
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:27,420
But something else is here!

20
00:01:27,504 --> 00:01:28,630
Dammit…

21
00:03:03,933 --> 00:03:05,018
EPISODE 27: SKY GUY

22
00:03:05,101 --> 00:03:08,187
Emporio, control the helicopter!

23
00:03:08,271 --> 00:03:12,817
I'm trying to put it back in auto-pilot!

24
00:03:12,901 --> 00:03:15,153
We're under attack.

25
00:03:15,945 --> 00:03:17,614
What did it do to us?

26
00:03:19,324 --> 00:03:22,160
Hurry! We're tilting down to the right!

27
00:03:22,243 --> 00:03:26,414
I can't see anything!
My eyelids won't budge!

28
00:03:27,248 --> 00:03:29,792
There's definitely something in here!

29
00:03:34,923 --> 00:03:38,843
Are you sure?
My web of strings can't detect it.

30
00:03:38,927 --> 00:03:41,221
Yeah! It slid in through the window.

31
00:03:41,304 --> 00:03:44,140
It moves quickly so I didn't notice.

32
00:03:45,934 --> 00:03:50,146
Shit. Its speed wouldn't be a problem
if we can figure out its position!

33
00:03:51,606 --> 00:03:54,192
Can you get rid of it
if we learn its position?

34
00:03:54,275 --> 00:03:56,527
If we knew its direction of speed?

35
00:03:56,611 --> 00:03:58,279
Yeah, I'm certain of it.

36
00:03:58,363 --> 00:03:59,405
All right.

37
00:04:00,823 --> 00:04:02,116
Ermes,

38
00:04:02,825 --> 00:04:04,953
how fast are we going right now?

39
00:04:05,036 --> 00:04:07,038
Is it 170kph? Or 200kph?

40
00:04:07,121 --> 00:04:07,956
What?

41
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:10,625
We're ditching this ride. Emporio!

42
00:04:12,085 --> 00:04:14,963
What?

43
00:04:16,631 --> 00:04:18,299
You're crazy, Jolyne!

44
00:04:18,383 --> 00:04:19,926
We won't survive this height!

45
00:04:22,679 --> 00:04:26,057
I can see it now!
Yes, I can read where it is!

46
00:04:28,643 --> 00:04:30,728
I got it! I smashed it!

47
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,442
That wasn't the only one!

48
00:04:36,526 --> 00:04:40,446
Ermes, we can't drop any lower. Hang on!

49
00:04:58,089 --> 00:04:59,757
Emporio, are you okay?

50
00:04:59,841 --> 00:05:01,926
I can open my eyes.

51
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:03,886
I can see again.

52
00:05:03,970 --> 00:05:06,180
What happened?

53
00:05:06,264 --> 00:05:09,142
Don't let your guard down.
They're not through with us.

54
00:05:09,726 --> 00:05:11,602
There were dozens of them!

55
00:05:12,228 --> 00:05:15,940
Also, they're not Stands.
They're living organisms!

56
00:05:16,899 --> 00:05:18,651
What are these things?

57
00:05:18,735 --> 00:05:22,155
So the enemy Stand User
can control these creatures?

58
00:05:22,238 --> 00:05:25,491
Wait, I've seen it somewhere.

59
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,997
Until now,

60
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:35,585
I couldn't even drive a car.

61
00:05:35,668 --> 00:05:39,339
But recently, I'm learning to focus.

62
00:05:39,964 --> 00:05:42,383
I have enough focus to shoot down
a helicopter out of the air.

63
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:47,180
I have no doubt.

64
00:05:47,722 --> 00:05:49,766
He is one of the presences I sensed.

65
00:05:50,349 --> 00:05:51,809
You must be the priest's ally.

66
00:05:55,396 --> 00:05:56,898
Rikiel,

67
00:05:56,981 --> 00:05:59,650
think of the man named Dio.

68
00:05:59,734 --> 00:06:02,612
ORLANDO STATE HOSPITAL

69
00:06:03,488 --> 00:06:06,074
Think of your bloodline,

70
00:06:06,866 --> 00:06:10,703
sons who have never known your father.

71
00:06:11,579 --> 00:06:13,289
Both of my eyelids

72
00:06:13,372 --> 00:06:16,667
close shut out of the blue.

73
00:06:18,503 --> 00:06:20,379
I always get like this.

74
00:06:21,964 --> 00:06:23,341
I went to the doctor,

75
00:06:23,424 --> 00:06:26,385
but there's nothing
physically wrong with me.

76
00:06:27,011 --> 00:06:28,596
That's all they ever say.

77
00:06:28,679 --> 00:06:31,057
I was 16 when it started.

78
00:06:31,140 --> 00:06:33,851
I was taking my end-of-year exam.

79
00:06:33,935 --> 00:06:36,395
Suddenly, I couldn't breathe.

80
00:06:37,188 --> 00:06:38,689
The people around me

81
00:06:39,273 --> 00:06:41,901
either pitied or ignored me.

82
00:06:41,984 --> 00:06:44,195
That made me sweat even more.

83
00:06:44,987 --> 00:06:46,906
That was the last time I went to school.

84
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:51,536
I can't see! My eyelids! I can't breathe!

85
00:06:52,578 --> 00:06:55,998
Goodness, my hands and forehead
are covered in sweat!

86
00:06:56,582 --> 00:06:59,252
This happens when I get overwhelmed.

87
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:03,548
Rikiel.

88
00:07:03,631 --> 00:07:05,633
I don't have an ability!

89
00:07:05,716 --> 00:07:07,510
I'm a good-for-nothing!

90
00:07:07,593 --> 00:07:10,513
But you do. I see it in you.

91
00:07:10,596 --> 00:07:13,099
You happened to never come around to it.

92
00:07:16,269 --> 00:07:20,273
Have you heard of creatures called "rods"?

93
00:07:20,356 --> 00:07:23,276
They are also known as "skyfish."

94
00:07:25,236 --> 00:07:28,114
They are cryptids.

95
00:07:28,614 --> 00:07:33,161
Not much is known about them,
and their corpses are rarely found.

96
00:07:33,244 --> 00:07:37,248
TV crews have attempted
to capture them in the past,

97
00:07:37,331 --> 00:07:40,626
but failed due to their insane speed.

98
00:07:41,127 --> 00:07:43,045
They're too fast for the naked eye,

99
00:07:43,129 --> 00:07:46,507
thus have only been seen on video footage.

100
00:07:46,591 --> 00:07:48,342
I looked into your ability disc.

101
00:07:48,968 --> 00:07:52,513
I found out that these rods

102
00:07:52,597 --> 00:07:55,725
have a habitat here in Florida.

103
00:08:06,152 --> 00:08:09,489
Are you talking about them, Father?

104
00:08:11,616 --> 00:08:14,160
I saw them. Just now!

105
00:08:15,661 --> 00:08:17,830
My eyes are open!

106
00:08:17,914 --> 00:08:22,001
Can I control these creatures,
and that's my ability?

107
00:08:24,128 --> 00:08:27,381
Did one of them touch me just now?

108
00:08:27,465 --> 00:08:31,093
No, it didn't. However…

109
00:08:35,097 --> 00:08:38,059
Rods were around me all this time.

110
00:08:38,643 --> 00:08:40,478
Now get going, Rikiel.

111
00:08:40,561 --> 00:08:44,565
Starting today, your Stand ability
shall be known as Sky Guy.

112
00:08:45,191 --> 00:08:48,069
Learn about the rods' mechanisms

113
00:08:48,152 --> 00:08:49,654
and use them to your advantage.

114
00:08:49,737 --> 00:08:52,698
Leave it to me. I feel like I'm reborn.

115
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:59,664
I'm no longer a mutt panting for air.

116
00:09:01,415 --> 00:09:02,500
"Rods"?

117
00:09:02,583 --> 00:09:04,919
Yeah. If these are rods,

118
00:09:05,002 --> 00:09:07,755
we can unravel its mechanism
by finding out their sustenance.

119
00:09:07,838 --> 00:09:11,509
No one knows what they feed on.

120
00:09:12,134 --> 00:09:14,762
Rods are able to fly around
without colliding into objects.

121
00:09:14,845 --> 00:09:16,931
The secret lies in their sustenance!

122
00:09:17,431 --> 00:09:20,101
Emporio, stay back.

123
00:09:20,643 --> 00:09:22,228
Come closer,

124
00:09:22,311 --> 00:09:24,772
Jolyne Cujoh and Ermes.

125
00:09:24,855 --> 00:09:28,609
For the rods' attack
to deal precise damage,

126
00:09:28,693 --> 00:09:30,528
I'll just wait for them to close in…

127
00:09:30,611 --> 00:09:32,780
Hey, don't get too close to him.

128
00:09:32,863 --> 00:09:34,615
We have to learn more
about his ability first.

129
00:09:36,492 --> 00:09:39,370
He was willing to expose himself

130
00:09:39,453 --> 00:09:42,498
because the closer he is,
the more precise his attacks are.

131
00:09:42,582 --> 00:09:47,920
He also chose a confined space
like the helicopter,

132
00:09:48,004 --> 00:09:52,216
because attacks in an open field
won't be precise.

133
00:09:53,009 --> 00:09:54,176
Calm down.

134
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:57,597
The range of their Stands
is less than two meters.

135
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:01,851
They can't strike
unless they're close, either. 

136
00:10:03,144 --> 00:10:04,729
Dammit!

137
00:10:04,812 --> 00:10:06,647
I parked my bike on mud.

138
00:10:06,731 --> 00:10:08,816
I have to rev it up and
move it to more solid ground.

139
00:10:08,899 --> 00:10:11,068
Where's my key? Where'd I put it?

140
00:10:16,532 --> 00:10:17,867
The rocks made a curve!

141
00:10:17,950 --> 00:10:20,953
He didn't even try to deflect the throw!

142
00:10:21,037 --> 00:10:23,414
Yeah, I have no idea how that happened.

143
00:10:23,497 --> 00:10:25,207
But Emporio,

144
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:27,543
the rocks didn't change their course.

145
00:10:33,758 --> 00:10:35,176
One more!

146
00:10:38,179 --> 00:10:39,263
I can't breathe!

147
00:10:42,224 --> 00:10:44,769
My eyelid, it's twitching!

148
00:10:47,813 --> 00:10:50,066
There they are, Ermes.
I can see them clearly.

149
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:52,026
They're flying all around!

150
00:10:55,613 --> 00:10:58,032
The rods are suspended in air!

151
00:10:58,115 --> 00:10:59,742
He's having a panic attack

152
00:10:59,825 --> 00:11:03,120
and is losing control over his ability!

153
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:08,250
Turns out you're here
to get a good beating!

154
00:11:10,336 --> 00:11:13,464
There it is! I never took the key out!

155
00:11:16,384 --> 00:11:17,635
My hand!

156
00:11:19,303 --> 00:11:22,556
It was July 1969.

157
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:27,061
Neil Armstrong made history
as the first man to walk on the moon

158
00:11:27,144 --> 00:11:28,813
on the Apollo 11 mission.

159
00:11:28,896 --> 00:11:33,192
I never understood its significance.

160
00:11:35,403 --> 00:11:39,907
It's engineers and scientists
who fly rockets to space.

161
00:11:39,990 --> 00:11:41,784
Even monkeys can become astronauts.

162
00:11:41,867 --> 00:11:46,622
But the first time
I fully caught sight of rods,

163
00:11:46,705 --> 00:11:48,749
it finally dawned on me.

164
00:11:48,833 --> 00:11:53,421
The first step on the moon
was made by humanity's willpower.

165
00:11:53,504 --> 00:11:56,966
On that same day,
humanity left the earth and evolved.

166
00:11:57,049 --> 00:12:01,470
Mental evolution is invaluable!

167
00:12:01,554 --> 00:12:04,682
My hand! It's rotting away!

168
00:12:04,765 --> 00:12:09,770
It's bloody! My pee is bloody!

169
00:12:11,105 --> 00:12:12,690
I can't feel my legs!

170
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:15,484
What the hell did you do?

171
00:12:16,068 --> 00:12:19,738
You choose to stand in the way
of the priest's evolution.

172
00:12:19,822 --> 00:12:22,700
My hatred burns hotter than tempered iron,

173
00:12:23,951 --> 00:12:26,454
and I choose to eliminate you all!

174
00:12:33,252 --> 00:12:34,962
STAND NAME: SKY GUY
STAND MASTER: RIKIEL

175
00:12:35,546 --> 00:12:37,006
Jolyne Cujoh.

176
00:12:37,089 --> 00:12:40,634
You're next,
but I'll finish you all at once.

177
00:12:49,310 --> 00:12:50,728
He targets the inside of our bodies.

178
00:12:50,811 --> 00:12:52,605
Unless the attack is internal,

179
00:12:53,189 --> 00:12:55,149
a physical blow wouldn't
twist her up like that.

180
00:12:55,733 --> 00:12:56,859
The inside of our bodies?

181
00:12:58,903 --> 00:13:00,070
This imprint!

182
00:13:00,654 --> 00:13:02,406
I'm starting to understand.

183
00:13:02,907 --> 00:13:04,825
Jolyne, our body heat!

184
00:13:04,909 --> 00:13:07,495
Rods feed on our body heat!

185
00:13:08,496 --> 00:13:11,123
Bloody urine is caused by kidney damage.

186
00:13:11,207 --> 00:13:14,418
Jotaro's disc kept one kidney safe,

187
00:13:14,502 --> 00:13:18,214
but the other side is cool to touch
from losing body heat!

188
00:13:19,215 --> 00:13:21,467
When I was at the ghost room,

189
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:24,512
I read something from a book
on the second row of the shelf.

190
00:13:25,179 --> 00:13:27,389
A damaged body part

191
00:13:27,473 --> 00:13:31,060
is colder than the rest of the body.

192
00:13:32,102 --> 00:13:33,979
If your hand is robbed of heat,

193
00:13:34,063 --> 00:13:36,982
the fingers curl and eventually rot.

194
00:13:37,566 --> 00:13:39,693
Chill the eyelids and they droop.

195
00:13:40,277 --> 00:13:42,029
Chill just one kidney,

196
00:13:42,112 --> 00:13:43,864
and blood enters the urine stream.

197
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:44,907
The rods,

198
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:49,662
they convert body heat from others
into their own energy!

199
00:13:50,246 --> 00:13:52,414
They come close, but they never touch.

200
00:13:52,998 --> 00:13:54,500
You don't realize what they've done,

201
00:13:54,583 --> 00:13:56,418
until an illness takes a toll on you.

202
00:13:57,002 --> 00:13:59,505
You little know-it-all.

203
00:14:00,464 --> 00:14:02,132
He's right,

204
00:14:02,216 --> 00:14:05,886
but I don't cause the illness to kill you.

205
00:14:05,970 --> 00:14:08,597
I only meant to immobilize.

206
00:14:09,431 --> 00:14:11,934
To strike you on a specific body part,
that is!

207
00:14:13,185 --> 00:14:17,273
Cooling this certain body part is fatal.

208
00:14:17,356 --> 00:14:20,359
The body part which controls
each and every organism.

209
00:14:20,943 --> 00:14:22,570
It's the brain stem!

210
00:14:22,653 --> 00:14:25,406
I will now steal your body heat
from your first vertebra.

211
00:14:25,489 --> 00:14:27,575
Now, strike!

212
00:14:27,658 --> 00:14:30,953
Jolyne, the water!
Get your head under water.

213
00:14:31,036 --> 00:14:34,081
No, Emporio. Give me your lighter.

214
00:14:34,164 --> 00:14:35,833
The ghost lighter.

215
00:14:35,916 --> 00:14:36,750
Give it to me.

216
00:14:45,885 --> 00:14:47,469
This is too reckless!

217
00:14:48,554 --> 00:14:50,472
This is nothing

218
00:14:50,556 --> 00:14:52,808
compared to everything else
we've been through.

219
00:14:52,892 --> 00:14:55,728
Compared to finding that priest,

220
00:14:55,811 --> 00:14:57,313
this is nothing.

221
00:14:59,982 --> 00:15:02,067
This bitch!

222
00:15:03,402 --> 00:15:07,740
I'm mentally stronger than her.

223
00:15:11,827 --> 00:15:13,120
Where?

224
00:15:14,163 --> 00:15:15,080
Find it,

225
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:19,251
find a target to finish her off!

226
00:15:25,424 --> 00:15:26,675
- What the…
- She got him!

227
00:15:27,301 --> 00:15:28,552
A star-shaped birthmark.

228
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:30,137
I don't know who you are,

229
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:32,389
but I guess you can tell us
about the priest.

230
00:15:32,473 --> 00:15:35,267
After we give you a good beating, that is.

231
00:15:36,602 --> 00:15:40,230
Think of your bloodline.

232
00:15:40,898 --> 00:15:42,524
That's right, I've changed.

233
00:15:49,073 --> 00:15:49,907
No.

234
00:15:50,491 --> 00:15:53,410
Rods cannot focus on one body part

235
00:15:53,494 --> 00:15:55,996
when the target is covered in flames.

236
00:15:56,080 --> 00:16:00,334
But if I'm also covered in flames,

237
00:16:00,417 --> 00:16:01,961
I would know exactly.

238
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:04,797
I can find your vulnerable spot

239
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:07,174
through my own senses.

240
00:16:08,801 --> 00:16:11,470
My heart soars like Apollo 11.

241
00:16:11,553 --> 00:16:15,015
Jolyne Cujoh, I will surpass you!

242
00:16:18,352 --> 00:16:20,854
Jolyne, hurry up and finish him!

243
00:16:28,821 --> 00:16:30,072
What are you doing?

244
00:16:30,155 --> 00:16:32,491
He's behind you!

245
00:16:33,742 --> 00:16:36,954
You can't see me now, can you?

246
00:16:38,122 --> 00:16:42,209
I found your weakness
by setting myself on fire.

247
00:16:42,292 --> 00:16:46,422
It's the mouth, left open to breathe!

248
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:51,844
The thalamus is a relay station
for all sensory information.

249
00:16:51,927 --> 00:16:53,637
It sits above the upper jaw in your mouth.

250
00:16:53,721 --> 00:16:56,432
Rods enter through your mouth

251
00:16:56,515 --> 00:16:58,142
and rob your body heat away.

252
00:16:59,184 --> 00:17:01,437
The rods targeted your thalamus.

253
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:05,065
Your eyes can't register me anymore!

254
00:17:06,358 --> 00:17:10,654
Victory is mine!
I won't have any more panic attacks.

255
00:17:11,155 --> 00:17:14,366
I will reclaim my life!

256
00:17:15,117 --> 00:17:17,828
I am Apollo 11!

257
00:17:18,871 --> 00:17:20,122
I don't need my sight.

258
00:17:20,873 --> 00:17:23,876
The rods are targeting my mouth?

259
00:17:23,959 --> 00:17:25,335
Then I won't breathe either.

260
00:17:29,882 --> 00:17:32,509
Rikiel first came after the helicopter.

261
00:17:33,427 --> 00:17:36,764
Just as I sensed
The Green Baby's position,

262
00:17:36,847 --> 00:17:40,059
and just as the priest sensed
that I've broken out…

263
00:17:43,479 --> 00:17:45,647
I will ask what you are.

264
00:17:46,231 --> 00:17:48,442
Next, I will ask

265
00:17:48,942 --> 00:17:49,860
what the priest is planning.

266
00:17:58,077 --> 00:18:00,370
Her resolve is stronger than ever before.

267
00:18:00,954 --> 00:18:03,874
Jolyne's determined to reach the priest.

268
00:18:03,957 --> 00:18:08,087
She inherited the conviction
from her father Jotaro Kujo.

269
00:18:08,170 --> 00:18:11,548
Is this the same Jolyne
who used to cry over nothing?

270
00:18:16,095 --> 00:18:18,097
You won.

271
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:24,019
But it is I, Rikiel, who will help
the priest get to Heaven.

272
00:18:24,603 --> 00:18:27,773
Rods have already infected my body.

273
00:18:28,524 --> 00:18:32,528
The nerves in my head and body
have been cut off.

274
00:18:32,611 --> 00:18:36,156
I'm now numb to any pain or shock.

275
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,075
I will fight until I die.

276
00:18:39,201 --> 00:18:41,120
Take my life in exchange for yours.

277
00:18:41,954 --> 00:18:44,623
Will you defeat me first?

278
00:18:44,706 --> 00:18:48,085
Or will the rods rob your body heat first?

279
00:18:49,128 --> 00:18:54,800
My palm extinguished the flame
covering your first vertebra!

280
00:18:57,427 --> 00:18:59,096
I'll kill you!

281
00:19:00,347 --> 00:19:03,142
Get her, rods!

282
00:19:03,225 --> 00:19:04,226
Jolyne!

283
00:19:14,153 --> 00:19:16,113
Jolyne!

284
00:19:16,196 --> 00:19:17,281
Jolyne!

285
00:19:24,121 --> 00:19:26,165
What is this?

286
00:19:26,915 --> 00:19:28,125
Shit.

287
00:19:28,208 --> 00:19:30,210
I intentionally subdued the fire
covering her neck

288
00:19:30,294 --> 00:19:32,796
so that the rods can rob her body heat.

289
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:36,216
My hand… dammit.

290
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:38,135
My hand is numb.

291
00:19:38,218 --> 00:19:39,595
My fingers

292
00:19:40,262 --> 00:19:42,431
kept her neck safe!

293
00:19:44,391 --> 00:19:46,059
Fuck.

294
00:19:48,937 --> 00:19:52,149
- Jolyne!
- Jolyne won!

295
00:19:53,483 --> 00:19:58,947
Did you mean to keep my hand on your neck
before you beat me down?

296
00:19:59,448 --> 00:20:01,825
Or was it all a coincidence?

297
00:20:02,409 --> 00:20:03,785
It was a fluke.

298
00:20:03,869 --> 00:20:05,120
I was desperate.

299
00:20:06,246 --> 00:20:10,167
An answer I hoped for. How kind.

300
00:20:10,751 --> 00:20:11,919
Do you mean it?

301
00:20:12,502 --> 00:20:14,004
What are you?

302
00:20:14,713 --> 00:20:16,840
Why did you go to the priest?

303
00:20:17,841 --> 00:20:21,178
Listen. I'm content right now.

304
00:20:22,137 --> 00:20:24,681
Before, I couldn't even ride a car.

305
00:20:25,182 --> 00:20:28,101
Now, I can breathe just fine.

306
00:20:29,686 --> 00:20:33,774
The priest filled a hole in my heart.

307
00:20:33,857 --> 00:20:37,027
That's why I gave up my life for him.

308
00:20:38,403 --> 00:20:40,489
Running through the priest's veins

309
00:20:40,572 --> 00:20:45,077
is the conviction of a man named Dio.

310
00:20:45,744 --> 00:20:50,624
Dio's will draws the sons to the priest.

311
00:20:51,708 --> 00:20:57,172
We are merely pawns of fate
who help the priest reach heaven.

312
00:20:58,173 --> 00:20:59,800
Jolyne Cujoh,

313
00:20:59,883 --> 00:21:02,052
you are no exception.

314
00:21:02,552 --> 00:21:06,515
You reaching Cape Canaveral
will only serve the priest's purpose.

315
00:21:06,598 --> 00:21:08,767
I now understand.

316
00:21:09,309 --> 00:21:11,478
You said so yourself,
it was a coincidence.

317
00:21:12,271 --> 00:21:16,608
You didn't mean for my hand
to stay on your neck.

318
00:21:16,692 --> 00:21:18,485
Nothing but luck.

319
00:21:19,194 --> 00:21:21,655
It doesn't matter whether I win or lose.

320
00:21:21,738 --> 00:21:24,157
I understand now.

321
00:21:25,367 --> 00:21:28,870
The priest needs your luck.

322
00:21:29,705 --> 00:21:31,873
Coincidences that tilt in your favor.

323
00:21:31,957 --> 00:21:33,458
That is what he wishes for!

324
00:21:34,167 --> 00:21:38,547
You have the strongest fate
out of anyone else.

325
00:21:39,631 --> 00:21:40,465
Is it me?

326
00:21:40,549 --> 00:21:42,384
Or is it you?

327
00:21:42,467 --> 00:21:46,763
The priest needs the one
with the stronger fate.

328
00:21:47,347 --> 00:21:49,933
The strongest power of this universe

329
00:21:50,017 --> 00:21:52,769
isn't attained through calculations.

330
00:21:54,021 --> 00:21:56,356
Fate gathers and takes shape.

331
00:21:57,566 --> 00:21:59,818
That man also has a unique fate.

332
00:21:59,901 --> 00:22:03,113
That is why the priest extracted
only his memory

333
00:22:03,655 --> 00:22:06,491
and kept him alive all this time.

334
00:22:08,243 --> 00:22:09,911
Weather Forecast.

335
00:22:11,538 --> 00:22:14,666
If that man breaks free,

336
00:22:14,750 --> 00:22:17,336
then it's not to help your cause.

337
00:22:18,211 --> 00:22:21,965
He will carry his powerful fate
to the priest.

338
00:22:22,591 --> 00:22:25,969
When a new star-shaped birthmark
emerged on Father Pucchi,

339
00:22:26,553 --> 00:22:30,682
the same must have appeared
on Weather's shoulder.

340
00:22:33,060 --> 00:22:36,146
He is the priest's younger brother.

341
00:22:38,523 --> 00:22:41,943
Don't waste your time listening
to his nonsense.

342
00:22:42,569 --> 00:22:43,862
My sister was killed

343
00:22:43,945 --> 00:22:47,449
by Sports Maximum,
who revived Dio's bones.

344
00:22:47,532 --> 00:22:51,036
Was that also for fate's sake? Bullshit.

345
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:53,288
The priest exists
so that I can beat him to a pulp.

346
00:22:53,997 --> 00:22:56,041
Let's go to Orlando.

347
00:22:56,124 --> 00:22:58,001
We need to go find the priest.

348
00:23:00,629 --> 00:23:05,092
Was it really a coincidence that
Jolyne didn't move Rikiel's hand?

349
00:23:05,175 --> 00:23:07,677
Or was it intentional?

350
00:23:08,386 --> 00:23:12,307
Jolyne didn't say a word
until the very end.

351
00:23:12,390 --> 00:23:13,642
RIKIEL
STAND NAME: SKY GUY - BEYOND RECOVERY

352
00:23:13,725 --> 00:23:15,644
FOUR MORE DAYS UNTIL THE NEW MOON

353
00:23:17,104 --> 00:23:19,523
Under Florida's transportation law,

354
00:23:19,606 --> 00:23:25,570
bikers are not legally required
to wear helmets.

355
00:23:25,654 --> 00:23:29,074
Though tragic fate may befall a biker,

356
00:23:29,157 --> 00:23:33,078
an individual's right to keep
the head uncovered is prioritized.

357
00:23:33,829 --> 00:23:36,248
They are free to choose for themselves.

358
00:23:37,124 --> 00:23:38,959
They have been free since long ago,

359
00:23:40,001 --> 00:23:42,087
and they will continue to
enjoy such freedom.

360
00:23:42,170 --> 00:23:45,090
RODS - SOMEWHERE ON THIS EARTH

361
00:23:46,258 --> 00:23:47,968
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
